  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint : Locus implies diameter of the hyperbola\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\text {i.e. } y=\\frac{b^2}{a^2 m} x \\quad(m=2) \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow y=\\frac{9}{8} x \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow 9 x-8 y=0\n\\end{aligned}$",
